    "answer": "If the imam sat mistakenly in the 3rd, you should notify him by saying subhana Allah If he doesn’t listen and rectify his mistake by standing up to the 4th, you must leave him and stand up to your fourth and finish you prayer alone. It is not permissible to follow him in that as it is not permissible to follow him if he were to stand up to the 5th rakah for example. The prayer is invalid for dropping a whole rakah and that can’t be compensated by sujood assahu.",
