    "answer": "It's not permissible to delay this prayer. You must immediately pray it as soon as you get up or remember. If you delay it until dhuhr, it's not permissible to pray and not valid. If you didn’t get a chance to pray it due to a legitimate reason and it was time for the congregation, you should pray with them the first two rakah as your own Fajr and when they stand for the 3rd, you should conclude your fajr prayer, offer salam and then stand up and begin your thuhur with them. When they conclude their thuhur, you should stand up and complete what remains from your own thuhur.",
