    "published": true,
    "answer": "It is mandatory to pray when you enter the masjid if you want to sit down. It can be a voluntary prayer or even fard. There's no separate prayer called Tahiyatul Masjid, it's just a name given by scholars. As for the hadeeth of the Bedouin, this can be looked at as talking about the pillars of Islam or that this particular prayer of honoring the masjid was not yet obligated. The same can go for funeral, eclipse, Friday and many other prayers.",
