    "question": "I've read that if a woman is sure that her menstruation is over before sunrise, and she intends to fast, her fast will be valid even if she delays ghusl until morning. But what if she isn't able to do ghusl even in the morning or throughout the day because of an illness e.g. high fever? Is her fast valid? What about the prayers throughout the day?",
