    "slug": "from-the-ayyah-in-suratul-jumaah-we-should-close-and-leave-our-business-and-go-to-pray-does-that-work-only-for-men-because-in-our-city-most-people-would-let-their-wives-selling-until-when-they-are-o",
    "question": "From the ayyah in suratul jumaah we should close and leave our business and go to pray, does that work only for men, because in our city most people would let their wives selling until when they are out of the masjid. Is that permissible as women are obligated to go to masjid for jumaah prayer?",
    "content": "It is prohibited to buy and sell after the athan of Friday for men to men. But women selling to other women or disbelievers, this is permissible.",
    "excerpt": "It is prohibited to buy and sell after the athan of Friday for men to men. But women selling to other women or disbelievers, this is permissible.",
    "categories": [
      "prayer"
    ],
    "author": "Sheikh Assim Al Hakeem",
    "date": "2019-12-08",
    "featured": false,
    "published": true,
    "answer": "It is prohibited to buy and sell after the athan of Friday for men to men. But women selling to other women or disbelievers, this is permissible.",
