    "question": "In the world Most of the normal peoples who missed fardh salah intentionally and non intentionally.so they have more pending salah.In our location(India) i asked this question what to do with the pending salah to my alim.he replied you should not do sunnath salah instead you want balance your pending fardh salah.what's the correct ruling and answer for this ?",
