    "slug": "if-a-person-forgets-to-bow-in-the-fourth-rakah-of-obligatory-prayer-remembers-it-in-the-tashadud-then-should-he-stand-again-complete-the-rakah-considering-it-as-fourth-or-should-he-finish-of-his",
    "question": "If a person forgets to bow in the fourth rakah of obligatory prayer & remembers it in the tashadud, then should he stand again & Complete the rakah, considering it as fourth or should he finish of his prayer & again pray the whole Salah? As bowing is one of the Arkan of the salah.",
