    "question": "I have to take bus to and fro my home and office.If i do overtime (which is sometimes required) the maghrib prayer falls during that journey.I arrived at home about 20-25 minutes after the azan of maghrib.The surrounding atmosphere is not completely dark while i arrived home.So,is it permissible for me to pray after returning home or should i pray in bus while sitting?",
