    "excerpt": "The hadeeth of the Prophet salla Allahu alaihi sa sallam is clear. &#8220;Whoever goes to a fortune teller, Allah will not accept his prayers for 40 days&#8221; The hadeeth talks about going to a fortune teller. When one reads about this in a novel, he didn't go to one. It is like someone telling [&hellip;]",
