    "question": "shaykh, on twitter u said it's not mandatory to wear cap 4 salah, what if 1 wearing it 24/7 for the sake of Allah same like Dr Zakir, is there reward from Allah? Or no need to wear it at all, it's only culture? im wearing it since 1 year with shirt/T-shirt, if possible answer with details,",
