    "excerpt": "We take our Islam from the Quran and from the Sunnah. First of all, she has to prove to us that Imam Abu Haneefa said this. She has to bring us the book and page and exact words of this great Imam. Everyone can come and claim that this Imam or that said this or [&hellip;]",
