    "question": "I prayed Asr thinking the time was in, and then when I checked after prayer it was 6 minutes in, and I am positive I prayed during the time it came in but I suffer from waswas which is making me think that I started before time, is my prayer valid?",
    "content": "If you began your prayer while the time was not due, repeat your prayer because it is invalid.",
