    "question": "I am 5 month pregnant and sometimes when I sneeze the pressure of the sneeze affects my bladder and some urine may come out. if I am praying and this happens do I have to stop my salat and do &#8220;taslim&#8221; and go for wudu or can I finish my salat and afterward have wudu for another prayer time.",
