    "question": "In India, some companies do not allow their employees to perform SALAH in duty timings. I have heard that if we are slaves and if our boss does NOT allow to practice our religioneven Jumu'ah Salah is forgiven. What is the Ruling for the Indian employees especially who is working in private sectors, Who has problem offering salah in their duty timings?",
